Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:46.77,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}弄られて垂れ流す　音のない音
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.00,0:01:46.77,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}遭受命運的玩弄 唯能吟唱無聲之音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:52.55,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}遍く　名前を捨てたのね　あなたのモザイクが泣いてる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.77,0:01:52.55,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}將名字盡數捨棄 只見你哭泣的模糊身影
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:57.34,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}Can not, can not, not, not, not deny 紛れもなく真実
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.55,0:01:57.34,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}無法 無法 無法將之否認 不折不扣的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:02:02.23,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}さあ　預けて　回帰するように
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.34,0:02:02.23,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}請你託付於我 只為就此歸來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:08.23,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}エネルギーはサイクル　そう　いまは無重力
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.23,0:02:08.23,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}能量循環往復 此刻已然失重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:15.53,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}象徵的なバレード　この月夜に仰げよ仰げ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.23,0:02:15.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}象徵性的遊行 於月夜抬頭仰望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}'completeness'
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.20,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}'完好無缺'
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:20.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}ああ　命の灯を揚げ
