Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.65,0:02:54.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}只因我們都很孤獨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:59.49,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}Alone, 噛み締めても　まだ痛むなら
