Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:13.34,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}oh, when you bleed, 惑星にそう　その影を伸ばせ
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.33,0:03:13.34,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}當你流血 在行星上投下陰影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:19.68,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}ねえ　私の世界が知りたがっているわ　さあ
