Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:28.44,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord4\blur4\3c&H441188&\fax-0.15}You bleed, yes, bleed その血で　天(そら)の五線譜を書き換えれば
